				"section": "Handling thinking chunks",
				"text": "When reasoning_effort is set to \"high\", the response message.content is a list of chunks instead of a plain string. ThinkChunk (type: \"thinking\") contains the reasoning trace; TextChunk (type: \"text\") contains the final answer."
			},
